%%{init: {'theme': 'dark'}}%%
flowchart TD
    Start([Start Protocol E]) --> Fetch[Fetch XLK & SPY]
    Fetch --> Calc[Calculate Ratio: XLK / SPY]
    Calc --> SMA[Calculate 20-Day SMA of Ratio]
    
    SMA --> Decision{Current Ratio > SMA20?}
    
    Decision -- Yes --> Strong[Signal: STRONG]
    Strong --> ResultA[Keep Standard Aggressive Levels]
    ResultA --> End([End])
    
    Decision -- No --> Weak[Signal: WEAK]
    Weak --> Shift[Trigger Defensive Shift]
    
    subgraph Defensive_Action
        Shift --> Del[DELETE Level 1 Aggressive]
        Del --> Move[Shift L2 -> L1, L3 -> L2]
        Move --> CalcL4[Calculate Level 3 Disaster]
        CalcL4 --> Formula[Formula: Mean - 3*StdDev]
    end
    
    Formula --> End
